VALUES (3051, 'tt0058824', NULL, 'Lost in Space', 'Lost in Space', 'tv', 1965, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f7xArCMZPBW7SoCsqsOXvc3X8Ry.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/upqfQF1LBPf7IRZao0sxt1BHZlx.jpg', 'The space family Robinson is sent on a five-year mission to find a new planet to colonise. The voyage is sabotaged time and again by an inept stowaway, Dr. Zachary Smith. The family''s spaceship, Jupiter II, also carries a friendly robot who endures an endless stream of abuse from Dr. Smith, but is a trusted companion of young Will Robinson', NULL, NULL, 29.1384, 7.236, 0, 8.34333333333333371e+00, '2026-08-10 02:34:01', '2026-11-19 03:47:19')
